            "answer": "<p>[Confirm with Asha] Your seat is transferable to another hunter at any time. Add refund and cancellation terms here once decided.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are the cabins and lodging like?",
            "answer": "<p>You'll stay in heated log cabins at Cascades Camp & Conference Center in Yelm, WA. Cabins are shared with other attendees. [Confirm with Asha] Add how many people per cabin and what bedding is provided.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need to be an experienced hunter?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Sessions are built for both new and seasoned hunters. Whether you're filling your first tag or chasing a record-class animal, you'll leave with tactics you can use this season.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What should I bring?",
            "answer": "<p>[Confirm with Asha] Add the packing list (field clothing, boots, rain gear, notebook, etc.). The full list will also be in the 2027 Event Guide.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I'm flying in. What's the nearest airport?",
            "answer": "<p>Seattle-Tacoma International (SEA) is about one hour away. Portland International (PDX) is about two hours away. [Confirm with Asha] Add whether shuttle or carpool options are available.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I come by myself?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely. Many hunters come solo and leave with mentors, hunting partners and lifelong friends. Meals, campfires and shared cabins make it easy to meet people.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can my spouse, kids or partner attend?",
            "answer": "<p>[Confirm with Asha] Add whether guests can attend, any age minimum, and pricing for family groups. Family groups save $100 with a code at checkout.</p>"
